                  "text": "\u003cp style=\"margin:0;font-size:28px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-1.5px;color:#181a16\"\u003exem\u003cspan style=\"color:#728820\"\u003e.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e"
