                  },
                  "color": "#50574b",
                  "containerPadding": "12px 32px",
                  "fontSize": "16px",
                  "lineHeight": "175%",
                  "text": "\u003cp style=\"margin:0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.7;color:#858b7e\"\u003eA little less setup. A lot more possibility.\u003cbr\u003eYou received this service update as the workspace owner.\u003cbr\u003eBuilt with Xem · Email that feels like you.\u003c/p\u003e"
